<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 160-1 IN 2ND INNINGS V INDIA - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 160-1 IN 2ND INNINGS V INDIA - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>CALCUTTA, India 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were 160 for</p>
<p>one in their second innings, a lead of 259, at the close on the</p>
<p>third day of the second test against India on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 428 and 160-1, India 329.</p>
</text>
